{
  "title": "Projectile Target Challenge: Pick Angle and Speed",
  "description": "A launcher sits at the left end of a flat 70 m field with tick marks every 10 m. A red target pad with a flag sits down the field. Set the launch angle (the barrel tilts) and speed, then press Launch: an orange ball flies its arc over about two seconds, drawing a trail. The previous shot's arc stays as a faded grey path. Hit targets at 30 m, 45 m and 18 m within 10 launches.",
